!/WallyApps/HittingApp/data/2025 Season -cleaned.csv
!/WallyApps/HittingApp/data/2026 Season - cleaned.csv
!/WallyApps/HittingApp/data/2026 Squads - cleaned.csv
/WallyApps/PitchingApp/data/*
!/WallyApps/PitchingApp/data/2025 Fall -cleaned.csv
!/WallyApps/PitchingApp/data/2025 Season -cleaned.csv
!/WallyApps/PitchingApp/data/2026 Season - cleaned.csv
!/WallyApps/PitchingApp/data/2026 Squads - cleaned.csv
