# Player Health ships its source plus the supplied ArmCare, PULSE, TrackMan,
# and roster seed files so a fresh deployment has every non-VALD workspace.
# The large generated VALD cache, local package library, refresh logs, and raw
# handoff remain excluded; deployed VALD data is rebuilt through the API.
/Sports Science 2/TXST LOGOS/
/Sports Science 2/cmj_sprint_share_handoff/
/Sports Science 2/vald_shiny_app/.R-library/
/Sports Science 2/vald_shiny_app/.Renviron
/Sports Science 2/vald_shiny_app/data/
/Sports Science 2/**/*.Rapp.history
